      "side": 1,
      "message": "Usually Optionals are only used as return arguments in methods:\n\nprivate X mXInstance;\n\nOptional\u003cX\u003e getX() {\n    return Optional.ofNullable(mXInstance);\n}\n\nOptionals as parameters adds overhead. What problem are you trying to solve by using Optionals as the parameters?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 51,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 51,
        "endChar": 24
      },
      "revId": "a576d15011066193a5ec181336b004a31dbdd659",
