      "writtenOn": "2021-04-07T17:12:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "One of the benefit of the Optional is that it can provide a state that has not been set. Because the value of the network response is set by the network. It is possible that it has not been set and this may be information that outer classes want to know.",
