      "writtenOn": "2021-04-07T17:12:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, actually I rethink the appropriateness of the error code being defined in the class \"CapabilityRequestResponse\".\n\nThe responsibility of this class is to record the capabilities request result. It can have some simple logic check like \"isNetworkRespOk\". However, it should not have the responsibility to judge the error code and also store it.\n\nI remove the variable error code in this class and the value of the error code is judged in each *coordinator class.",
      "parentUuid": "c6162579_d788c011",
